-	return lv;
+	/* [OC PATCH] Stock efuse read almost always resolves Helio G70
+	 * (RMX2020) units to CPU_LEVEL_0 (LL 1700MHz / L 2000MHz / CCI
+	 * 1187MHz - see mtk_cpufreq_opp_table.h). CPU_LEVEL_2 ("PRO") is
+	 * the same silicon family's highest calibrated bin, already
+	 * carrying its own matched voltage table (LL 2000MHz / L 2202MHz
+	 * / CCI 1396MHz). Forcing it here is the overclock; it is NOT
